      "name": null,
      "problem": "Find $\\sqrt[3]{-\\frac{{a}^{3}}{8{x}^{3}}}.$",
      "worked_solution": "To simplify the expression, we write the term under the radical as a perfect cube, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{-\\frac{{a}^{3}}{8{x}^{3}}} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{(-\\frac{a}{2x})\\cdot (-\\frac{a}{2x})\\cdot (-\\frac{a}{2x})} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{{(-\\frac{a}{2x})}^{3}} & = \\\\ -\\frac{a}{2x}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
